    "q-182379": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182379",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∨(B∨A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |",
      "worked_solution": "First, we complete a truth table for the part in parentheses, $B∨A.$ The statement $B∨A$ is true if either $A$ is true, $B$ is true, or both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we look at the columns labeled $A$ and $B∨A$ to complete the column $A∨(B∨A).$ The statement $A∨(B∨A)$ is true if either $A$ is true, $B∨A$ is true, or both $A$ and $B∨A$ are true. \n\nThe completed truth table is shown below:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∨A\\,$ | $\\,A∨(B∨A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
