    "q-182382": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182382",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,(B∧A)∨B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |",
      "worked_solution": "First, we complete a truth table for the part in parentheses, $B∧A.$ The statement $B∧A$ is true if both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∧A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we look at the columns labeled $B∧A$ and the column $B$ to complete the column $(B∧A)∨B.$ The statement $(B∧A)∨B$ is true if either $B∧A$ is true, $B$ is true, or both $B∧A$ and $B$ are true.\n\nThe completed truth table is shown below:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,B∧A\\,$ | $\\,(B∧A)∨B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
