      "problem": "Simplify the statement $(T∨T)∧(U∧U).$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that:\n\n- the expression $T∨T$ simplifies to just $T,$ and\n\n- the expression $U∧U$ simplifies to just $U.$\n\nSo, the given statement can be simplified to\n\n$$\nT∧U.\n$$",
