      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Simplify the statement $(P∧P)∧(Q∧Q).$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that:\n\n- the expression $P∧P$ simplifies to just $P,$ and\n\n- the expression $Q∧Q$ simplifies to just $Q.$\n\nSo, the given statement can be simplified to\n\n$$\nP∧Q.\n$$",
